sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SDD_SEQ_12_Business as Business transaction
  participant SDD_SEQ_12_DB as PostgreSQL
  participant SDD_SEQ_12_Worker as Mail worker
  participant SDD_SEQ_12_SMTP as Transactional sender / SMTP
  SDD_SEQ_12_Business->>SDD_SEQ_12_DB: commit mutation + audit/outbox + eligible job
  SDD_SEQ_12_Worker->>SDD_SEQ_12_DB: claim pending/retry job with fenced lease
  SDD_SEQ_12_DB-->>SDD_SEQ_12_Worker: safe stored recipient and event data
  SDD_SEQ_12_Worker->>SDD_SEQ_12_SMTP: send stable transactional message
  alt SMTP accepts
  SDD_SEQ_12_SMTP-->>SDD_SEQ_12_Worker: accepted
  SDD_SEQ_12_Worker->>SDD_SEQ_12_DB: fenced success / receipt
  else retryable delivery failure
  SDD_SEQ_12_SMTP-->>SDD_SEQ_12_Worker: failure
  SDD_SEQ_12_Worker->>SDD_SEQ_12_DB: record error and next retry
  else exhausted attempts
  SDD_SEQ_12_Worker->>SDD_SEQ_12_DB: record terminal failure
  end
